   "dap": "<ul><li>Cùng $a$ (dây không dãn)</li><li>Cùng $T$ (dây, ròng rọc nhẹ)</li><li>Chiều dương đi vòng theo dây</li></ul>",
   "tieu_muc": "4. Tình huống 3: hai vật nối dây qua ròng rọc",
   "hinh": "<figure class=\"fig\" data-exp=\"tn-l10-giaibt-dlh-02\" data-tl=\"1\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 420 290\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Khối m1 trên mặt bàn nằm ngang nối dây qua ròng rọc ở mép bàn với quả nặng m2 treo thẳng đứng. Lên m1: P1 xuống, N1 lên bằng P1, lực căng T sang phải, ma sát sang trái. Lên m2: T hướng lên, P2 hướng xuống dài hơn T. Chiều dương: m1 sang phải, m2 hướng xuống\"><line x1=\"10.0\" y1=\"150.0\" x2=\"318.0\" y2=\"150.0\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" opacity=\"1\"/><line x1=\"308.0\" y1=\"150.0\" x2=\"308.0\" y2=\"284.0\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" opacity=\"1\"/><line x1=\"312.0\" y1=\"150.0\" x2=\"332.0\" y2=\"142.0\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" opacity=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"332\" cy=\"142\" r=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"172.0\" y1=\"128.0\" x2=\"332.0\" y2=\"128.0\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" opacity=\"1\"/><line x1=\"346.0\" y1=\"142.0\" x2=\"346.0\" y2=\"204.0\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" opacity=\"1\"/><rect x=\"128\" y=\"106\" width=\"44\" height=\"44\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"rgba(251,146,60,.18)\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"328\" y=\"204\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"rgba(56,189,248,.18)\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"150.0\" y1=\"128.0\" x2=\"150.0\" y2=\"28.0\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"2.8\"/><path d=\"M144.2,38.0 L150.0,28.0 L155.8,38.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"2.8\" stroke-linejoin=\"miter\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-linecap=\"butt\"/><line x1=\"150.0\" y1=\"128.0\" x2=\"150.0\" y2=\"228.0\" stroke=\"#f87171\" stroke-width=\"2.8\"/><path d=\"M155.8,218.0 L150.0,228.0 L144.2,218.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f87171\" stroke-width=\"2.8\" stroke-linejoin=\"miter\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-linecap=\"butt\"/><line x1=\"150.0\" y1=\"128.0\" x2=\"190.0\" y2=\"128.0\" stroke=\"#fb923c\" stroke-width=\"2